{"detail": {"templateUuid": "2315dbeac81f4f67a5bd59fa7e09bd27", "projectUuid": "6d5dae3507e4422ba72b71e88f361886", "name": "机甲师的最后一舞", "description": "退役机甲师与即将报废的老机甲，用一支舞完成跨越生死的告别。\n在灰蒙蒙的废铁场，编号 021 的机甲静静等待着被拆解。它的驾驶员，一位中年退役女兵，在它被熔炼的前一天，偷偷启动了这台沉睡多年的战争机器。\n没有炮火，没有厮杀。夕阳下的废弃跑道上，机甲笨拙地抬起钢铁手臂，踩着老情歌的节拍，和它的老战友跳了最后一支舞。\n当能源核心熄灭的那一刻，它完成了此生最温柔的任务。", "coverUrl": "/assets/48914eda85821647.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/a2c3a6e4d8be46d2b996da29d7a9994e/1133344dca1791d1eb7b8747909830404b5be1ee.mp4", "snapshotId": 15935, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 9421180, "ownerUuid": "a2c3a6e4d8be46d2b996da29d7a9994e", "avatar": "/assets/5a5f6a6ed08d057c.webp", "nickname": "weigu", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 87, "tags": [{"id": 3035, "code": "prod", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.2《AI，想象和尖叫》", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3035/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/user/self?from_tab_name=main&modal_id=7646373337609866548&showSubTab=video&showTab=post", "createAt": "2026年06月01日 18:59", "updateAt": "2026年06月08日 20:26", "publishAt": "2026年06月01日 18:59", "honors": ["最佳剧情"], "awardedTag": ["最佳剧情"], "playCount": 86, "viewCreationProcessCount": 34, "copyCanvasCount": 8, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/2315dbeac81f4f67a5bd59fa7e09bd27.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 50, "edges": 86}}, "recommendList": []}